## 4. Pehle integration architecture fix karo

Canonical frontend blueprint aur execution plan ko check karke F06 ke routes aur implementation status ko sahi tarah register karo. Existing route conventions aur authentication boundaries ko follow karo. Fictional routes ya duplicate folders create mat karo.

Ek hi canonical folder rakho:
`src/features/f06_save_compare/`

Search, Property aur Project ke Save/Compare actions ko ek shared F06 state/data adapter se jodo. Saved aur Compare screens ko isi shared state se records milne chahiye. Search, Property aur Project pages par alag-alag unrelated Save/Compare state mat rakho.

Account-backed persistence service abhi verified nahi hai. Jab tak approved service actual mein connect nahi hoti:
- Data ko clearly session-only batao.
- UI mein account sync connected hone ka jhootha claim mat karo.
- Fake saved listings, fabricated prices, availability, verified data ya backend functionality mat banao.
- Private account data ya credentials ko `localStorage`/browser storage mein mat rakho.
- Session adapter aur future approved account-persistence adapter ki boundaries alag rakho.
- `ShareComparison` ke generated comparison IDs ke liye real restoration/hydration behaviour implement karo ya clearly disabled rakho; sirf URL copy ko functional comparison reopening mat batao.

## 5. PowerShell → GitHub workflow

Meri preference local-only development nahi hai. PowerShell ka use Git/repository diagnostics aur controlled repository operations ke liye karo, taaki final changes canonical GitHub branch tak pahunch sakein.

Pichhle chat mein GitHub connector ke through branch create karne ki koshish `403 Resource not accessible by integration` se fail hui thi. Koi F06 integration code commit nahi hua. Isliye bina verify kiye yeh claim mat karna ki integration save ho chuki hai.

Ab:
1. Available PowerShell/Git execution capability check karo. Agar is chat mein meri machine ka PowerShell directly accessible nahi hai, to saaf batao; mere PC ko remotely control karne ka jhootha claim mat karo.
2. Agar execution available nahi hai, to ek hi complete, safe PowerShell block do jisse main canonical repository checkout par branch/status verify kar sakun aur changes GitHub tak push kar sakun. Pehle `git status`, current branch, remote aur HEAD verify karo; stale checkout assume mat karo.
3. Reset, force-push, blind merge, destructive cleanup ya `data/state.json` ko modify mat karna.
4. Ek root cause/fix group ek baar mein implement karo. GitHub par commit/push hone ke baad actual commit SHA aur CI run verify karo.
5. PowerShell output agar kisi error ka evidence de, usi error ko pehle fix karo; unrelated audits dobara mat chalao.

